、80%机率给予目标8秒睡眠(无法行动且防御固定为0,受到技能攻击后解除(通常攻击或含通常攻击的技能除外) )、给予目标12秒感电(650点持续伤害、受到攻击时给予随机队友相当于持续伤害20%的追加伤害、一定机率消除当前技能充能)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 108px;\"><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"z-index:10;min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">大招U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"z-index:10;min-height:20px;width:auto;\">防御力最高的敌人优先,给予3名目标7573点伤害、85%机率给予目标8秒睡眠(无法行动且防御固定为0,受到技能攻击后解除(通常攻击或含通常攻击的技能除外) )、给予目标12秒感电(650点持续伤害、受到攻击时给予随机队友相当于持续伤害20%的追加伤害、一定机率消除当前技能充能)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 44px;\"><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"z-index:10;min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">队长技</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"z-index:10;min-height:20px;width:auto;\">队长增益防御型的敌人技能充能量-18% (PVP时再追加10%)</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">天子评价</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:20px;width:auto;\">PVP天子，肉盾杀手（说的就是你，吴亦凡），减速达人，乱斗强度大于竞技场，点火后又臭又硬。</div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 94233, "username": "水间新月", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/4.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content